   "departmentNumber" : "13",
   "description" : "<div class=\"product-details-wrapper-au\">\n      <!--Second Call Out start-->\n          \n      <!--Second Call Out end-->\n    <div class=\"product-detail-dsc-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"product-detail-title-wrapper\">\n          <h5 class=\"product-detail-title\">Description</h5>\n        </div>\n\n      <!--Description start div-->\n      <div class=\"product-detail-dsc\">\n        \n        <h2>Coffex Supremo Coffee Beans 1kg</h2>\n        <p>The Supremo blend has an exotic, complex flavour that transports you to faraway destinations. The blend is carefully crafted from 100% Arabica beans from the finest coffee growing regions in the world to produce a distinctively strong coffee. Sweet and clean from start to finish, with notes of tropical fruit and an underlying caramel tone, the Supremo makes a beautiful coffee, time and again.</p>\n        \n        \n        <br><br><div class=\"coo-logo-frame-bk\">\n    <div class=\"coo-text-bk\">Imported Beans Packed in Australia</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <!--Description div end-->\n\n      <div class=\"clearboth\"></div>\n    </div>\n  <!--Nutrition Facts start-->\n  \n  <!--Nutrition Facts end-->\n  \n</div>",
